%% HEADS
#set-of-poled-heads
(* is #in #tomb-of-the-unknown-implementer)
(name *)	set of poled heads
(* is sacred)
(dict *)	head pole poles pdl bkd taa marc imple loser heads set poled
(appearance *)
	There are four heads here, mounted securely on poles.
