%% COKES
#bunch-of-coke-bottles
(* is #in #tomb-of-the-unknown-implementer)
(name *)	bunch of Coke bottles
(item *)
(dict *)	bottl coke cokes bunch bottles
(* size is 15)
(appearance *)
	Many empty Coke bottles are here. Alas, they can't hold water.
(initial appearance *)
	There is a large pile of empty Coke bottles here, evidently produced by
	the implementers during their long struggle to win totally.
%% TODO: object action routine COKE-BOTTLES

%% LISTS
#stack-of-listings
(* is #in #tomb-of-the-unknown-implementer)
(name *)	stack of listings
(item *)
(readable *)
(flammable *)
(dict *)	paper list print listi stack lists listings
(* size is 70)
(appearance *)
	There is an enormous stack of line-printer paper here. It is barely
	readable.
(initial appearance *)
	There is a gigantic pile of line-printer output here. Although the paper
	once contained useful information, almost nothing can be distinguished
	now.
(descr *)
    <DEFINE FEEL-FREE \(LOSER\)
        <TELL \"FEEL FREE, CHOMPER!\">>
            ...
    The rest is, alas, unintelligible \(as were the implementers\).

